stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unknown : iCem.exe start (no active case) — reg1=0
    Unknown --> NotStarted : case opened — reg1=1
    NotStarted --> InProgress : acquisition started — reg1=2
    InProgress --> Completed : acquisition completed — reg1=3
    InProgress --> Suspended : acquisition suspended — reg1=4
    Suspended --> InProgress : acquisition resumed
    Unknown --> SimulationRunning : simulation mode — reg1=5
    SimulationRunning --> Unknown : simulation end
    Completed --> Unknown : case closed/next case

    note right of InProgress
        reg1 = RealtimeState enum passthrough (tap-exposed ONLY):
        Unknown=0 NotStarted=1 InProgress=2
        Completed=3 Suspended=4 SimulationRunning=5
        source: CementCase.RealtimeCase.RealtimeState
        (vendor enum, ¬ invented — v5 replaces the v4
        None/Initializing/Initialized/Recording/Capturing
        guess-map which had NO tap backing)
    end note

    note left of InProgress
        reg3 heartbeat: +1/s ALWAYS while AddIn loaded
        (pipeline-alive), wrap 32000→0, decoupled from
        Streaming — v5 PARADIGM CHANGE vs v4 reg5
        (streaming-linked heartbeat = FROZEN HISTORY)
    end note

    note right of Unknown
        reg2 = LANManager.LANStatus passthrough:
        None=0 Selected=1 Streaming=2 Recording=4
        LostConnection=8 Pausing=16 (ComPortStates)
    end note

    note left of Unknown
        reg0 = D1 first-valid-wins latch:
        number of COM device actively feeding (1..16),
        0=none; other devices discarded; re-arbitrate
        only on stream loss
    end note

