stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : module load (no bus writes yet)
    Idle --> Active : MarkWritten (pair/line landed;\nheader flag raised BY THE WRITE —\nUpdateZoneHeaderLocked)
    Idle --> Idle : Poll (any silence) — no-op,\nno repeated posts (no bounce)
    Active --> Active : MarkWritten (evidence refreshed)
    Active --> Active : Poll, silence ≤ 5 s\n(boundary == timeout is NOT beyond)
    Active --> Idle : Poll, silence > 5 s —\npost SetZoneActive(zone,false) EXACTLY ONCE\n(FLAG ONLY — body cells never zeroed)

    note right of Active
        STALE-HOLD: Active→Idle touches the header
        flag byte ONLY (com@18 / lan@27 / raw@36);
        data cells persist byte-exact indefinitely.
        Reconnect = MarkWritten → Active (counter
        continues from the header-persisted value).
    end note
